          "message": {
            "text": "NewDeployment sets only OLLAMA_BASE_URL, OPENAI_API_BASE_URL, ENV=dev, WEBUI_NAME, KEY_FILE and the deployment is exposed on host <workspace>.<defaultDomain> with no auth. Open WebUI permits open registration by default and grants administrative control to the first registered account; nothing here disables signup, bootstraps an admin, or fronts the UI with authentication."
          },
