          "message": {
            "text": "GetSystemPromptPattern builds the Modelfile with fmt.Sprintf over raw spec.models/spec.patterns values: a pattern containing \"\"\" followed by a newline terminates the SYSTEM block and injects arbitrary Modelfile directives, which the operator submits to the workspace Ollama /api/create. The embedded fabric pattern map that could serve as an allow-list is dead code (variables.go embeds are never referenced)."
          },
